<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Geo raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Geo raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Credit Suisse First Boston analyst Rafael Elias-Pinero raised his rating on Mexican builder Corporacion Geo Tuesday to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- He called the company's first quarter results &quot;truly spectacular.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares in Geo were up 0.25 peso to 36.55 pesos Tuesday.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
